<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-UHIS TO EXTEND HOUSING LOAN TERM.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-UHIS TO EXTEND HOUSING LOAN TERM.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank, the second largest bank in Estonia, said in a statement on Monday that it will extend its housing loan term from 15 to 20 years from Wednesday.</p>
<p>Uhispank has been granting long-term housing loans since autumn of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
